{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <strong><em><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2396/content00795?type=0\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">#链产品&nbsp;</span></a></em></strong> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #3f75f3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">引 言</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">作为古代&ldquo;海上丝绸之路&rdquo;重要节点，当今的泉州制造业颇为发达。但随着人口红利的削减，泉州的制造业面临着数字化和智能化、品牌化的转型新问题。在这样的背景下，奇龙数字产业基地运营管理（泉州）有限公司选择了&ldquo;京东物流供应链基地&rdquo;解决方案，并<span style=\"color: #3f75f3;\">成立了&ldquo;京东物流供应链泉州基地&rdquo;</span>，加速产业带品牌孵化以及数字化转型进度。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1691135438894.png\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1691135452559.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01326", "contentTitle": "京东云仓走进“海上丝绸之路”，助力泉州产业带企业转型", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1691134224000, "id": 3245, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1691135465554.png", "updateTime": 1691135704000}}